{"synopsis":"Pertempuran dengan archnemesis dilanjutkan setelah 300 tahun. Si jenius penyihir, Lynn, memulai perjalanan besar, pada usia 13 tahun. Bersama dengan rombongan hero yang dipimpin oleh Esther, mereka bertujuan untuk mengalahkan kejahatan besar “Abyss” yang bermaksud mengacaukan dunia. Namun, pertempuran menjadi semakin sengit dan pada saat terakhir, Lynn tunduk pada racun gelap “Abyss”. Meninggalkan kata-kata “Aku akan kembali”, jiwa Lynn jatuh tertidur selama 300 tahun, sebelum dibangkitkan kembali ke dalam tubuh seorang anak laki-laki kelahiran bangsawan. Dengan demikian dimulai kehidupan keduanya di dunia yang damai. Tetapi dalam waktu yang bersamaan, kekuatan gelap sedang mengerumuni sekali lagi, mengancam untuk kembali menjatuhkan dunia ke dalam kekacauan.","alternative_title":"The Great Mage of the Hero's Party Reincarnates, The Great Wizard Who Was Revived After 300 Years, 용사파티 대마법사의 환생","author":"Potetorusu, Jeonghoon","artist":"Potetorusu","chapters":[{"number":"146","chapter":"146","slug":"8707783e-e1db-4791-8f9a-8f59822582d8","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"number":"145","chapter":"145","slug":"4ed9bb00-f074-4d54-8a0b-f3eaa7bd94ab","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"number":"144","chapter":"144","slug":"10a57239-4724-4399-bc67-926dd12e7f2f","date":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"number":"143","chapter":"143","slug":"024a44f9-e326-4ab3-9d7a-33b48f6bcac2","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"number":"142","chapter":"142","slug":"bef5587a-2847-4776-8950-cf895ef6a06c","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"number":"141","chapter":"141","slug":"19f56386-0169-43bd-b399-72c148e34c30","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"number":"140","chapter":"140","slug":"2a0dc20b-b1ec-4e08-ad4d-b0b2e39e052b","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"number":"139","chapter":"139","slug":"bd07a1f3-b582-4afe-8d64-cdf337d3ed32","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"number":"138","chapter":"138","slug":"115479b6-dc66-4859-9df9-233547b27549","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"137"